{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And YHWH saw.</b> This is the angel of HaShem, and he was given permission to speak in the name of HaShem." "<b>For he turned aside to see.</b> Every usage of סר — if a mem follows it, its meaning is 'to turn away,' as in 'סורו ממני'; and if an alef or a lamed follows it, its meaning is 'to draw near,' as in סורה אלי."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:55:54.840144545Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}